From f457b16d1aa813b12d556614a5ae9d282091ab20 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Adam Dinwoodie <adam@dinwoodie.org>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 10:37:18 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] gc: add experimental registration-time candidate ordering

Repeated limited collections can favor the same filesystem enumeration
order. Add gc-registration-order to prefer older registered candidates
after unregistered entries, while preserving existing liveness checks
and dependency-safe deletion.

Keep timestamp snapshots and sorting local to whole-store deletion GC,
without schema or protocol changes. Cover ordering, early stopping,
roots, cleanup, and unchanged modes with unit and functional tests, and
document daemon-side enablement.

Assisted-by: GitHub Copilot (OpenAI GPT-6.1 Sol)
Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
